{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33702","headline":"读惠山若冰师集因题故院三首 一 · 李骘","name":"读惠山若冰师集因题故院三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五天何处望，心念起皆知。\n化塔留今日，泉鸣自昔时。\n古苔生石静，秋草满山悲。\n莫道声容远，长歌白雪词。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李骘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33702.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33702","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}